<title>USA: RFS Hotel to raise credit line to $175 mln.</title>
<headline>RFS Hotel to raise credit line to $175 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>RFS Hotel Investors Inc said Friday it has raised its bank line of credit to $175 million from $75 million.</p>
<p>The company said $100 million of the credit is unsecured.</p>
<p>NationsBank Corp is the lead bank in the syndicated facility, the company said.</p>
<p>The additional credit will assist the company in acquiring new hotels, the company said.</p>
</text>
